# Handoff

Before implementing, read `docs/STATUS.md`. That file is the source of truth for phase, decisions, and next work. Do not restart from chat transcripts if it is current.

After finishing a phase, a major architectural choice, or a session that is about to run out of context: update `docs/STATUS.md` (current phase, what shipped, decisions, pitfalls, remaining work). Do not start the next phase unless asked.

Never put `FIVE11_API_KEY` or other secrets in git, `AGENTS.md`, `docs/STATUS.md`, or rules.
